{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "懷", "id": "懷"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "說", "id": "說"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.1080910326226534, "source": "惡", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.3608540011180215, "source": "弟", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.7471483622379123, "source": "弟", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "弟", "target": "懷"}, {"weight": 2.0243817644968085, "source": "弟", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.054001181677967, "source": "弟", "target": "去"}, {"weight": 3.2771447329921766, "source": "弟", "target": "父"}, {"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "弟", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.8716796248840124, "source": "弟", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.3608540011180215, "source": "父", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "父", "target": "懷"}, {"weight": 2.0243817644968085, "source": "父", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.054001181677967, "source": "父", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 3.054001181677967, "source": "父", "target": "去"}, {"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "父", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.8716796248840124, "source": "父", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 0.9257694758286988, "source": "親", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.955388893009857, "source": "臣", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.178532444324067, "source": "臣", "ta